{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"scss","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"SCSS and Sass","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SCSS and Sass (.scss .sass).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"scss","name":"SCSS and Sass","extensions":[".scss",".sass"],"grammar":"grammars/scss.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"SCSS and Sass","path":"snippets/scss.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/scss.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[a-z-]+\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,8}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z-]+(?=\\\\s*:(?!:))\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[.#&][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?(?:px|em|rem|%|vh|vw|s|ms|deg)?\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:@keyframes|@font-face|@function|@supports|@forward|@include|@at-root|@import|@return|@extend|@mixin|@while|@media|@debug|@error|@else|@each|@warn|@use|@for|@if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/scss.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Mixin\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mixin\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@mixin ${1:name}(\\\\$${2:arg}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A mixin\"\n  },\n  \"Include\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"inc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@include ${1:name}(${2});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use a mixin\"\n  },\n  \"Variable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"var\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$${1:name}: ${2:value};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variable\"\n  },\n  \"Media query\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@media (min-width: ${1:768px}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A media query\"\n  },\n  \"Each\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@each \\\\$${1:item} in ${2:\\\\$list} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An each loop\"\n  },\n  \"Flex center\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"display: flex;\",\n      \"align-items: center;\",\n      \"justify-content: center;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Center with flex\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# SCSS and Sass\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SCSS and Sass.\n\n## Files\n\n`.scss`, `.sass`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mixin` | A mixin |\n| `inc` | Use a mixin |\n| `var` | A variable |\n| `mq` | A media query |\n| `each` | An each loop |\n| `fc` | Center with flex |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}